# Line endings: everything that runs inside the Linux container or under a POSIX shell must keep
# LF on every checkout, including Windows with core.autocrlf=true (a CRLF shebang or Dockerfile
# line breaks the image build, the container entrypoint and the shell shims).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
# Binary files that may appear in examples or assets
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.mp4 binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.pdf binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
